>
  <div class="cat-color-bar" style="--cat-color: var(--cat-math);"></div>
  <div class="container">
    <Breadcrumb items={[{ label: 'Math' }]} />
    <div class="cat-hero" style={`--cat-color:${accent};--cat-bg:${accentBg};`}>
      <span class="cat-hero-badge" style={`color:${accent};background:${accentBg};border:1px solid rgba(8,145,178,0.15);`}>Math</span>
      <h1>Free math calculators and converters</h1>
      <p>Quick answers to everyday math questions. Percentages, grades, unit conversions, time zones, and more — all in your browser with no sign-up.</p>
    </div>

    <AdZone size="leaderboard" />

    <section>
      <div style="display: grid; gap: 20px;">
        <div class="hub-tool-card" style={`--cat-accent:${accent};`}>
          <h3><a href="/math/percentage-calculator/">Percentage Calculator</a></h3>
          <p>Three modes: what is X% of Y, X is what % of Y, and percentage change. Shows the formula and explains the result in plain English.</p>
          <a href="/math/percentage-calculator/" class="hub-tool-link">Use this tool</a>
        </div>
        <div class="hub-tool-card" style={`--cat-accent:${accent};`}>
          <h3><a href="/math/scientific-calculator/">Scientific Calculator</a></h3>
          <p>Full scientific calculator with sin, cos, tan, log, ln, factorial, and calculation history. Keyboard support included.</p>
          <a href="/math/scientific-calculator/" class="hub-tool-link">Use this tool</a>
        </div>
        <div class="hub-tool-card" style={`--cat-accent:${accent};`}>
          <h3><a href="/math/unit-converter/">Unit Converter</a></h3>
          <p>Convert between length, weight, temperature, volume, speed, area, energy, and pressure units. All conversions in one page.</p>
          <a href="/math/unit-converter/" class="hub-tool-link">Use this tool</a>
        </div>
        <div class="hub-tool-card" style={`--cat-accent:${accent};`}>
          <h3><a href="/math/time-zone-converter/">Time Zone Converter</a></h3>
          <p>Convert times across multiple time zones simultaneously. Perfect for scheduling with international clients.</p>
          <a href="/math/time-zone-converter/" class="hub-tool-link">Use this tool</a>
        </div>
        <div class="hub-tool-card" style={`--cat-accent:${accent};`}>
          <h3><a href="/math/gpa-calculator/">GPA Calculator</a></h3>
          <p>Calculate your GPA on a 4.0 scale. Add courses with letter grades or percentages and credit hours. Supports weighted grading.</p>
          <a href="/math/gpa-calculator/" class="hub-tool-link">Use this tool</a>
        </div>
        <AdZone size="square" />
        <div class="hub-tool-card" style={`--cat-accent:${accent};`}>
          <h3><a href="/math/grade-calculator/">Grade Calculator</a></h3>
          <p>Two modes: what grade you need on the final, and what your current grade is based on weighted assignments.</p>
          <a href="/math/grade-calculator/" class="hub-tool-link">Use this tool</a>
        </div>
        <div class="hub-tool-card" style={`--cat-accent:${accent};`}>
          <h3><a href="/math/age-calculator/">Age Calculator</a></h3>
          <p>Calculate exact age in years, months, and days. Includes next birthday countdown and fun facts about time lived.</p>
          <a href="/math/age-calculator/" class="hub-tool-link">Use this tool</a>
        </div>
        <div class="hub-tool-card" style={`--cat-accent:${accent};`}>
          <h3><a href="/math/tip-calculator/">Tip Calculator</a></h3>
          <p>Calculate tip amounts and split bills. Quick buttons for standard tip percentages.</p>
          <a href="/math/tip-calculator/" class="hub-tool-link">Use this tool</a>
        </div>
        <div class="hub-tool-card" style={`--cat-accent:${accent};`}>
          <h3><a href="/math/discount-calculator/">Discount Calculator</a></h3>
          <p>Calculate the sale price after a discount. Works with percentage off or fixed amount off.</p>
